    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Le romancier St\u00e9phane Belcourt a accept\u00e9 de parrainer le bicentenaire d\u2019une c\u00e9l\u00e8bre marque de cognac. C\u2019est l\u2019occasion de revenir pour la premi\u00e8re fois dans la ville o\u00f9 il a grandi. Sur place, il rencontre Lucas, le fils de son premier amour. Les souvenirs affluent : le d\u00e9sir irr\u00e9pressible, les corps qui s\u2019unissent, une passion qu\u2019il faut taire\u2026 Ce premier amour s\u2019appelait Thomas. Ils avaient 17 ans.",
        "english": "Upon agreeing to be the brand ambassador for a famous cognac celebrating their bicentennial, novelist St\u00e9phane Belcourt returns to his hometown for the first time in many years. Once there, he meets his first love\u2019s son, Lucas. Memories come rushing back to him: irrepressible attraction, bodies becoming one in the heat of desire, a passion that can never be revealed\u2026 His first love\u2019s name was Thomas. They were 17."
